        "en": "In a positive-definite energy bowl covariance is tau times A inverse and the mean is A inverse times h. At fixed A,T a linear source shifts the center alone. Changing cross energy changes contour orientation and correlation; that tilt is neither a time arrow nor a causal conclusion."
