        "en": "For the uncorrected kernel, test target preservation directly with pi P−pi. Target 1:2:4 drifts, whereas 1:1:4 is accidentally invariant under the same asymmetric proposal. Its stationary circulating current still equals 1/24. Neither “asymmetry always breaks invariance” nor “invariance implies detailed balance” is valid."
