        "en": "Choose the independent or collective mode once for the entire system. Independent mode draws N separate Bernoulli variables; collective mode copies one value everywhere. Each mode has the same one-site mean p, yet density variances differ. A diagram that chooses modes separately at each site would describe a different preparation."
