        "en": "For additive force the conjugate observable is Bj=−μ∂j lnρ=μxj/v. Use the spatial score, two-time correlation and the specified force operator together. Step mean is μA⁻¹(exp(At)−I)F; with rotation the static shift need not align with the force."
