    "en": "Instantaneous frictionless normal impact of a uniform rod with one floor endpoint. CCW omega is positive; restitution acts only when c<0. Inertia,impulse,states and budgets are exact rationals; length uses a numerical root. e0 may leave other motion; later trajectories/support forces are not solved."
