    "en": "Smooth constant-density periodic 2D family. Square edges are not walls. Pressure is a gauge, not absolute thermodynamic pressure. Initial amplitude is not mean velocity. RK4 trajectories are approximate; endpoint differences are not rigorous bounds. This does not certify 3D turbulence or a general solver."
